atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary p p f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
read_restart ../p1_lastforce_np1/bed.restart
neighbor 0.0005 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
timestep 1e-05
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 5000000.0 5000000.0
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.45 0.45
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.3
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.5
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
fix zwall1 all wall/gran model hertz tangential history primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
fix gravi all gravity 9.81 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0
fix integr all nve/sphere
fix lf all store/lastforce
dump d all custom 1000 dump.final id x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz omegax omegay omegaz
dump_modify d sort id format "%d %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g"
thermo 500
run 1000
